# Personal reaction phrases — inject at least one per note
reaction_phrases:
  - is this normal??
  - confused on this part
  - need verify
  - iirc
  - dont quote me but
  - might b wrong
  - need recheck
  - hmm
  - from the session today
  - wait no
  - actually
  - check this
  - TODO look into this more
  - hard to tell
  - not sure tho
  - need double check
  - pretty sure abt this
  - might be off here
  - gotta look this up
  - ok actually
  - weird tho
  - makes sense now
  - need to test this
  - still not clear on this
  - asked the speaker abt this
  - they mentioned it quickly
  - didnt catch the exact number
  - from the Q&A
  - the demo showed this
  - someone in audience asked same thing
  - revisit this

# Casual filler phrases that feel like real notes mid-sentence
filler_phrases:
  - speaking of whch
  - also
  - oh n
  - and then
  - which reminds me
  - btw
  - note to self
  - compare with
  - similar to last time
  - might b why
  - then again
  - on top of that
  - oh wait
  - forgot to mention
  - related to this
  - side note
  - kinda like
  - goes along with
  - from earlier today
  - from last week's talk
